    "goal": "Extrude bioink through a cryo-3 (500 µm) nozzle along a 47634 µm G-code path at 8.54 mm/min to fill a 9497 µm footprint at 140 µm line pitch, and report filament mass, print time, fill lines, extruded volume and deposition rate.",
    "rationale": "Pure bioprinting extrusion calculation. The extruded ink volume follows from the nozzle cross-section × path length (π(d/2)²·L); print time from path length ÷ feed rate; fill lines from footprint width ÷ line pitch (ceiling). Filament mass = volume × ink density (1.053 g/cm³); deposition rate = volume ÷ print time. Ink density 1.053 g/cm³ as stated; nozzle inner diameter 500 µm as stated for the cryo-3.",
